{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他顺着那股先于念头冒出来的冲动，没等心里踏实，就先把自己能做的那一份接了下来。\",\n      \"key\": \"能做的那一份\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他不甘心就这样认输，行动让他有了些力量，也让他有点骄傲，却仍不敢相信自己真能改变什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"不甘心就这样认输\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B5\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他还说不清自己究竟舍不得什么，一旦往前承担，就不敢再相信自己还能照旧留住那些珍惜的东西。\",\n      \"key\": \"舍不得什么\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\",\n        \"B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕一承认难过就退回原地，只好反复劝自己没事，可牵挂一冒出来，他又急着把自己撑住，始终安不下心。\",\n      \"key\": \"反复劝自己没事\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B3\",\n        \"B4\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S01-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R5\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-1\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留不再等到彻底想清才行动的关键转折，把抽象的行动原则落在先前已经出现的冲动和具体承担上。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R6\",\n        \"R7\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-2\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动带来的力量、骄傲、没有保证和仍然不甘心；用不甘认输却不敢确信结果写出这股力量的限度，删去重复的主体性格言，也为后文行动曾使他重新有力气保留依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R8\",\n        \"R9\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"替换\",\n      \"why\": \"投入本身带来快乐、倾尽全力的畅快以及不再审视软弱，都缺少珠子支持，且与焦灼和反复自我说服不合。改为他怕承认难过就退回原地，因而不断撑住自己。原来R8到R11的投入快乐因果不再成立；后文若承接行动经验，应改由S02-2的力量感解释松动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R10\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S02-3\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写并扩展\",\n      \"why\": \"保留行动高昂时仍有牵挂未被照顾的事实，并补足B1的原因：他尚说不清自己舍不得什么，开始承担后又不敢相信珍惜的东西还能照旧留住。这里不提前替他命名那份依恋，为后文逐渐辨认它留下空间。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4af87f9b-9860-4b2b-903a-ce241d7628fa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T050728987862Z", "elapsed_seconds": 371.938, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T05:13:40.930224+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "095ab389ceacec217dbfad506a1b1d4f7f1fca83883603b85bd921792cd3f0ab", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3